2
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:22,270
<i>♫ Love has to persist till the end ♫</i>

3
00:00:23,310 --> 00:00:29,610
<i>♫ Looking at you, I don't wish to escape anymore ♫</i>

4
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:34,780
<i>♫ Your smile is too beautiful ♫</i>

5
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:37,800
<i>♫ I find it hard to breathe ♫</i>

6
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:45,180
<i>♫ Will you say, say 'I do?" ♫</i>

7
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:48,730
<i>♫ You appeared, in my life ♫</i>

8
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:52,430
<i>♫ Hard to resist, I can't resist ♫</i>

9
00:00:52,430 --> 00:00:56,090
<i>♫ I will try, try my best ♫</i>

10
00:00:56,090 --> 00:01:00,450
<i>♫ Just because you give me the courage ♫</i>

11
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,820
<i>♫ Courage ♫</i>

12
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:11,090
<i>♫ I'm willing to give my all to you ♫</i>

13
00:01:11,090 --> 00:01:21,010
<i>♫ I just want to give you, give you happiness ♫</i>

14
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:30,350
<i>Customize Happiness</i>

15
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:32,780
<i>- Episode 33 -</i>

16
00:01:33,770 --> 00:01:39,390
The bags and shoes are her lifeblood. How can she sell them? You don't have any judgement at all.

17
00:01:39,390 --> 00:01:43,130
I never would've thought I'd be in such a hole, and I'm suddenly back to not being free again.

18
00:01:43,130 --> 00:01:47,990
I have been working in Beijing for ten years and this is what I have saved?

19
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:51,950
Sis, do you know that you have enough?

20
00:01:51,950 --> 00:01:56,040
$500 isn't that much, but how much counts as a lot?

21
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:58,130
$500 is enough for us to live on for a month.

22
00:01:58,130 --> 00:02:01,350
Must you have $100,000 to have money?

23
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:04,780
Moreover, you are not doing this alone. You still have me and Bei Bei.

24
00:02:04,780 --> 00:02:09,380
And even Brother Zhan, too. Even though he didn't meet any of your eighteen conditions,

25
00:02:09,380 --> 00:02:12,580
but... but he is sincere towards you.

26
00:02:12,580 --> 00:02:14,880
You should know this is most important.

27
00:02:14,880 --> 00:02:16,860
You must hold on to this happiness.

28
00:02:16,860 --> 00:02:19,770
Don't keep thinking about useless things, working your hardest to have "enough."

29
00:02:19,770 --> 00:02:22,550
If you want to put it nicely, you need to be strong.

30
00:02:22,550 --> 00:02:25,480
To put it not nicely, it's a fool's errand.

31
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:27,920
Sis, everything is fine.

32
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:30,500
You still have me. What are you afraid of?

33
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:34,330
You have your little brother. I'll hold up the sky so it doesn't fall on you.

34
00:02:34,330 --> 00:02:37,140
- Really? <br> - Don't worry. I need to.

35
00:02:37,140 --> 00:02:40,900
Okay, let's have $40 worth of roast duck tonight. You can pay for it.

36
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:43,020
Hey, Bei Bei, don't we have to get to your Lamaze class?

37
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:45,010
- Yes, it's late. We should sleep. <br> - It's time for the baby to sleep.

38
00:02:45,010 --> 00:02:46,490
- Where are you going?<br>- Sing...

39
00:02:46,490 --> 00:02:49,630
- a song for the baby later. <br> - ♫ Let's sleep.

40
00:02:49,630 --> 00:02:53,590
So unreliable.

41
00:02:54,660 --> 00:02:56,260
<i>[Bank account]</i>

42
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:02,460
There's no way to get past this.

43
00:03:06,050 --> 00:03:08,440
Sorry, I can't sign this agreement.

44
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:13,000
Don't be like that, Old Xu. We already agreed. You can't just change your mind like that.

45
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:16,760
Didn't I already introduce you? With Zhan Wang's experience and skills,

46
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:20,540
he just needs to practice a bit, and that new guy won't even be able to catch up to him.

47
00:03:20,540 --> 00:03:22,780
What I want now is results.

48
00:03:22,780 --> 00:03:26,950
You said earlier, the racing team hasn't shown any results.

49
00:03:26,950 --> 00:03:28,790
How could it not be?

50
00:03:28,790 --> 00:03:31,760
That single-lap record at Goldenport was set by Zhan Wang, wasn't it?

51
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:35,380
That record? It has already been broken.

52
00:03:38,810 --> 00:03:42,890
The person you want to collaborate with, is that Zhang Da Sheng?

53
00:03:43,590 --> 00:03:48,120
There's no harm in telling you, I suppose. Zhang Da Sheng was the only Chinese racer in so many European championship races.

54
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:50,970
He is the best in China.

55
00:03:50,970 --> 00:03:53,390
You can't criticize our decision to go with him.

56
00:03:53,390 --> 00:03:56,500
He's young, vigorous, he's fast.

57
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:59,730
These are facts. You are a racer, too.

58
00:03:59,730 --> 00:04:03,680
You should know this better. Time waits for no man!

59
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,370
I'm leaving.

60
00:04:11,790 --> 00:04:16,490
Bastard. I don't believe that!

61
00:04:16,490 --> 00:04:22,540
I, Gao Da Yong, even if I have to sell everything I own, will see this thing through. Let's drink.

62
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:29,080
Don't say anymore. The groceries are cheaper at the market.

63
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:31,350
We got so much stuff for $10.

64
00:04:31,350 --> 00:04:34,970
Of course. You don't eat the food of the common people every day.

65
00:04:34,970 --> 00:04:39,160
The groceries at the supermarket are more expensive. In future, let's buy them from the market.

66
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:41,800
Yes, the fish at the market are very fresh.

67
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,900
It's fresh and still alive.

68
00:04:46,430 --> 00:04:48,690
Hurry, pick them up! My tomatoes, tomatoes!

69
00:04:48,690 --> 00:04:50,980
Hurry up.

70
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:54,340
Thank you.

71
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:56,700
Thank you, Sir.

72
00:04:56,700 --> 00:05:00,590
Saved $2 on the carp.

73
00:05:01,230 --> 00:05:05,000
White cabbage, saved $5.

74
00:05:06,150 --> 00:05:09,480
Liquid detergent, $8.

75
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:13,480
Hurry up. Half a kilogram of pork,

76
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:17,650
it's $8.50 less than the supermarket.

77
00:05:17,650 --> 00:05:21,150
Dry cleaning bill...

78
00:05:21,150 --> 00:05:23,940
Dry cleaning bill.

79
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:26,290
$85.

80
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:29,170
How am I still losing money?

81
00:05:29,170 --> 00:05:30,950
Sis, you are too much.

82
00:05:30,950 --> 00:05:34,290
Wearing custom haute couture to go shopping at the market.

83
00:05:34,290 --> 00:05:36,100
- Isn't it your fault? <br> - Why are you blaming me?

84
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:39,640
If it wasn't for the ruckus you caused, would I be so poor?

85
00:05:41,030 --> 00:05:43,170
There are no more cucumbers.

86
00:05:43,170 --> 00:05:46,300
<i>[Dear valued client. The new Cannage bag from Dior which you have ordered has arrived</i>

87
00:05:46,300 --> 00:05:48,490
Why must it be at this time?

88
00:05:48,490 --> 00:05:51,870
We didn't have that many cucumbers in the first place.

89
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:55,260
I will cut some for you again.

90
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:11,020
- Brother Zhan. <br> - So how? <br> - The car is ready, but...

91
00:06:22,260 --> 00:06:23,940
Who are you?

92
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:27,360
Hi. I came here to say hello.

93
00:06:29,730 --> 00:06:31,380
Please get out from the car.

94
00:06:31,380 --> 00:06:33,490
It's not a big deal. You can sit in my car, too.

95
00:06:33,490 --> 00:06:36,880
No need. Thanks. Please get out from the car.

96
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:44,550
I heard you have prepared for a long time. I have been waiting,

97
00:06:44,550 --> 00:06:47,150
but you don't have the right to compete in the race.

98
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:49,990
Say that again.

99
00:06:49,990 --> 00:06:53,560
I said you don't have the right to compete in the race.

100
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:57,290
Brother Zhan, Brother Da Yong is looking for you.

101
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:05,920
<i>[Notice of cancellation of Zhan Wang's right to race]</i>

102
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:09,510
What does this mean?

103
00:07:11,650 --> 00:07:16,380
They checked your records. You haven't competed in a race for two years.

104
00:07:16,380 --> 00:07:19,040
They've already revoked your racing permit.

105
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:23,050
You don't have the right to compete. You need to take the test again.

106
00:07:23,050 --> 00:07:25,440
Take the test again?

107
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:31,300
Three months. Level C.

108
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:35,080
The race would have already ended! What test do you want me to take again?

109
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:43,820
I will resolve this matter. Don't bother about this.

110
00:08:01,060 --> 00:08:02,990
Looking for me?

111
00:08:02,990 --> 00:08:05,050
Don't ask when you already know.

112
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:10,440
Is the result that surprising? You don't have a record of competing for the past two years.

113
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:13,570
Revoking your permit is completely in keeping with the regulations.

114
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:18,030
You went to so much trouble to make me return to racing.

115
00:08:18,030 --> 00:08:21,090
Just so you could cancel my permit and teach me a lesson?

116
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:27,280
If you want to compete in the race, you need to take the test first.

117
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:31,520
Are you kidding me? Do you know there is no time now?

118
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:37,960
Zhan Wang, the "creme de la creme" of the racers will be at this race.

119
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:40,760
How can I prove that

120
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:44,920
you have the ability to compete?

121
00:08:45,890 --> 00:08:49,810
You're also a top racer, but I can beat you anyway.

122
00:08:51,820 --> 00:08:56,620
That was in the past but you can't defeat the young racers now.

123
00:08:56,620 --> 00:09:00,330
Okay, give me another chance.

124
00:09:00,330 --> 00:09:03,340
I will prove to you that I have the ability.

125
00:09:07,150 --> 00:09:09,870
This is interesting. How are you going to prove it?

126
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,810
Is everything ready?

127
00:10:32,690 --> 00:10:36,230
Hello, Director Cheng. This is Tian Xiao Ni.

128
00:10:36,230 --> 00:10:38,760
You still remember me?

129
00:10:47,620 --> 00:10:52,230
Director Pan, I remember you asked me to resign and join your company.

130
00:10:52,230 --> 00:10:55,490
Why are you not answering my calls now?

131
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:18,800
What's wrong?

132
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:24,400
Hey, Brother Zhan. Um, my sis is on a rampage here at home.

133
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:29,600
The three of us can't handle it anymore. Can you help?

134
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:31,000
What's wrong with your sister?

135
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:34,400
I don't know. Come here first, okay?

136
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,700
Bye-bye.

137
00:11:57,800 --> 00:12:01,000
What's wrong? Did you fight with them again?

138
00:12:01,970 --> 00:12:04,210
Did Tian Liang tell you again?

139
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:10,000
No. In the past, I wanted you to resign

140
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:14,600
so that you could relax and enjoy your life.

141
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:16,500
Look at you now.

142
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:21,600
My goal is very simple. It's just to rely on my ability

143
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:24,010
to become more remarkable

144
00:12:24,010 --> 00:12:26,200
and live a better life.

145
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:31,400
Why does God pull a prank on me when I'm almost there?

146
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:34,800
Everything has gone to zero and at the starting point again.

147
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:37,800
How could that be? Don't you have the talent?

148
00:12:37,800 --> 00:12:42,400
You can start again. You have your family, friends and me, too.

149
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:45,400
These can't be bought with money.

150
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:47,800
Of course, I know.

151
00:12:47,800 --> 00:12:52,600
These are the luxuries of life.

152
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:55,400
Can happiness give me money to support my family?

153
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:59,200
Thus, you should relax more.

154
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:03,000
Shouldn't you check

155
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:05,800
if you can lower your standards for happiness?

156
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:08,800
It's not that I haven't thought about lowering my standards,

157
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:12,400
but I have been applying this standard to myself for the past ten years.

158
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:15,600
You suddenly want me to give up everything I have

159
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:18,600
and deny the ten years of hard work?

160
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:21,400
If others don't understand me, will you, too?

161
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:24,600
I understand you and I'm not denying this, too.

162
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:28,800
I merely want you to relax more. You are in too much of a hurry.

163
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:33,000
Have you been out to have fun lately? Walk around somewhere, do something good for your heart?

164
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,500
Would I still have the mood to have fun?

165
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:38,200
Enjoying yourself is not a waste of time.

166
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:43,200
We should reassess our situation and our attitudes. Everything will be fine.

167
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:47,300
All these are logic. Anyone can understand this.

168
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:57,000
Don't talk about me. Let's talk about your race. Isn't everything going well?

169
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:01,000
I have my own ideas about the race. Don't bother about it.

170
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:05,700
- Okay, I won't bother about it at all. <br> - Xiao NI.

171
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:09,000
I was wrong. Sorry.

172
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:14,000
Look, you are making me anxious. I know you are concerned about me. Okay?

173
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,000
It's my fault.

174
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:21,000
I'm suddenly out of work and I don't know what to do.

175
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:24,600
I'm a little anxious, a little panicky. I'm not really used to it.

176
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:29,600
I know but do you know.

177
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:34,800
You are the most remarkable and strongest of all the women I have met.

178
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:39,000
I especially understand how you've worked so hard and suffered so much.

179
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:41,200
But don't forget,

180
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:45,400
you have me now. We are together.

181
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:49,000
No matter what obstacles you come across, I'll be the first one to block them from hitting you.

182
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:53,300
The days will better and they will be happier.

183
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,600
I believe it.

184
00:15:00,130 --> 00:15:01,880
The password is your birthday.

185
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:07,500
- Why are you giving me this? <br> - It's my savings.

186
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:13,200
Starting from today, manage this card for me.

187
00:15:14,100 --> 00:15:16,600
How can I take your money?

188
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:20,400
This belongs to us.

189
00:15:32,400 --> 00:15:34,800
Hello, Aunt.

190
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:39,400
I can see that Da Yong is very busy for the past two days. He doesn't need to come every day.

191
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:43,900
To add further, my leg has improved. I can take care of myself.

192
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:46,800
He's not really that busy.

193
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:50,800
This time, he is really doing something and that is taking care of you.

194
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:55,000
<i>If he doesn't treat you nice, call me.</i>

195
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,000
If he shortchanges you with a meal, tell me and I won't let him off.

196
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:01,000
No matter what, Da Yong is a Director.

197
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:06,400
You make him come to my home to cook three meals for me. I really feel bad about this.

198
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:09,200
Don't make him come again.

199
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:12,700
Who says it's not suitable? It's a done deal.

200
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:17,000
Hello?

201
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:22,200
Don't say hello anymore. She has already hung up. It's my Mom checking on me?

202
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:26,600
I think that... you come here every day;

203
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:32,400
moreover, you are dressed like this in my home... it's...

204
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:37,400
It's a pretty good look for me.

205
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:40,200
I'm much better. I can walk now.

206
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:41,800
- Who's that? <br> - I don't know.

207
00:16:41,800 --> 00:16:45,120
Don't move. You are a patient. Sit here.

208
00:16:45,800 --> 00:16:47,400
Who's there?

209
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:54,870
Director Gao?

210
00:16:58,330 --> 00:17:01,260
Jia Jia, you have a guest.

211
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,800
Xu Xin.

212
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:16,800
Gui Jia, I didn't expect you

213
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:18,500
to move that fast.

214
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:23,000
Don't leave.

215
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:27,600
Jia Jia, the guest is leaving. Why aren't you saying anything?

216
00:17:27,600 --> 00:17:30,800
Mister Xu, it's dinner time.

217
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:36,200
I just cooked dinner for Jia Jia. There is still some in the pot. You must have already eaten.

218
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:41,600
Actually, Gu Jia and I have been together for a few days.

219
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:45,200
I have always wanted to find the opportunity to tell you.

220
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:48,300
I didn't expect to be caught by you that fast. Sorry about this.

221
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:53,800
Gu Jia, I'm here to tell you that

222
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:57,000
it's impossible for the both of us and that we should break up.

223
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:59,800
- My best wishes to you. Thanks. <br> - Bye!

224
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:03,300
- Xu Xin! <br> - Take care!

225
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:07,000
Gao Da Yong, what are you doing?

226
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:12,500
Gu Jia, do you like suffering that much? He's not worthy of you! What are you hitting me for?

227
00:18:12,500 --> 00:18:18,000
Whether I'm willing or not, what business is that of yours? Don't think just because you cooked at my home for a few days that you are the master of the house!

228
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,400
Do you think I wanted to come here? My mom made me do it.

229
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:23,200
- Get lost! <br> - Fine!

230
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:49,000
Sis.

231
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:52,600
I saw that the weather is cold. I brought some clothes for you.

232
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:55,000
Do you think I can still wear those clothes?

233
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:59,200
Okay then. I'm leaving first.

234
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:02,400
Sis, don't be in such a hurry.

235
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:06,400
Look, here are some gifts from customers, skin products. I saved them for you.

236
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:11,600
No need. It's not like you don't know I don't like putting that stuff on my face.

237
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:14,200
Are you still angry with me?

238
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:19,400
Sis, seriously. I know you want to be good to Sister Xiao Ni.

239
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:23,800
You both are not blood related. Who's family and who's not?

240
00:19:23,800 --> 00:19:27,100
I'm not one of those who differentiate between that. I'm talking about being reasonable.

241
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:30,000
- You said that Sister Xiao Ni... <br> - Yes, I know.

242
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:32,600
She brought me here. I shouldn't have done that to her.

243
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:34,400
It's good that you know.

244
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:39,200
Sis, you only know how to think on behalf of others. Have you ever thought on behalf of your biological buddy?

245
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:42,600
Do you know? Even if I let her have the position,

246
00:19:42,600 --> 00:19:45,200
Bai Ruo Yan would never let her be the Boutique Manager, too.

247
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:48,000
Who is Bai Ruo Yan? We can't even defend ourselves against her.

248
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:53,000
Just because she sees someone suffering, she's going to give her a handout?

249
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:55,800
How is that possible? Let me tell you honestly.

250
00:19:55,800 --> 00:19:59,600
When I was working in the office, I overheard Bai Ruo Yan and a few of her working partners talking

251
00:19:59,600 --> 00:20:03,400
about blacklisting Sister Xiao Ni from this industry. You still don't get it?

252
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:08,200
No wonder. Xiao Ni recently wanted me to recommend work to her.

253
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:11,200
I already thought about this matter on your behalf.

254
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:16,200
I met a few customers today who are organizing a big design competition. They need another judge.

255
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:19,400
I went all out to recommend Xiao Ni for the job.

256
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:21,800
It's good if you can at least do this.

257
00:20:21,800 --> 00:20:25,400
Look at you. You are just biased towards me.

258
00:20:25,400 --> 00:20:29,200
Sis, no matter what, Sister Xiao Ni and I were colleagues. Isn't that so?

259
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:31,200
I can't see her in such a bad state.

260
00:20:31,200 --> 00:20:34,400
She is facing difficulties now. I need to help her.

261
00:20:34,400 --> 00:20:37,300
Okay, I'm thanking you on her behalf. I'm leaving first.

262
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:43,000
- Let's go. I will treat you to an expensive lunch. <br>- I don't want to go.

263
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:45,400
Let's go. Hurry up.

264
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:48,000
Let me get it for you. Let's go.

265
00:20:56,400 --> 00:21:00,500
Cui Cui wanted me to give this to you.

266
00:21:00,500 --> 00:21:02,400
Cui Cui told you to give it to me?

267
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:07,800
Yes. Yesterday, she told me that she has regretted and she was wrong in the past. And not to be angry with her anymore.

268
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:12,400
She wanted me to tell you that this is from her and that she was wrong.

269
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:18,400
Enough, Gu Jia. It must be from you.

270
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:21,000
Don't worry. I won't blame her.

271
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:24,700
It's only just a job. If I have lost it, I can find another.

272
00:21:28,600 --> 00:21:30,400
Bei Bei.

273
00:21:30,400 --> 00:21:33,500
- Wait for me. Coming. <br>- Open the door.

274
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:37,000
Move aside.

275
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:40,100
Tian Liang, what's wrong?

276
00:21:40,100 --> 00:21:43,600
- What's wrong? <br>- Everything's fine. <br> - Be careful.

277
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:45,800
What's going on?

278
00:21:45,800 --> 00:21:48,600
Sister Xiao Ni, I'm very sorry. I really can't take care of him.

279
00:21:48,600 --> 00:21:54,200
I asked him to just wash the cars, but he insisted on following me around to learn from me. I took my eyes off him for a second, and the car--

280
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,800
He was knocked down?

281
00:21:55,800 --> 00:21:59,200
No, he got his hand stuck in the car door.

282
00:21:59,200 --> 00:22:01,800
Lift his hand.

283
00:22:01,800 --> 00:22:04,000
He only hurt his hand. Why did he faint?

284
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:08,000
I took him to the hospital to get it bandaged, and while it was being bandaged a patient passed by with a head covered in blood.

285
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:11,200
He took one look and fainted. He gave me a shock.

286
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:16,000
So he faints at the sight of blood? Bei Bei, why did he faint?

287
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:18,400
I didn't know, too.

288
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:20,500
I didn't know that he faints at the sight of blood.

289
00:22:20,500 --> 00:22:23,800
It's okay. It's probably nothing major. You can hurry and get back to the garage now.

290
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:26,000
No, Sister Xiao Ni, I'm partly responsible for this, too.

291
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:29,000
It's not busy at the garage. There's no problem.

292
00:22:29,000 --> 00:22:32,800
You should be at the training circuit with Zhan Wang now for the practice runs.

293
00:22:32,800 --> 00:22:35,800
Huh? You didn't know?

294
00:22:35,800 --> 00:22:38,300
Brother Zhan...

295
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:43,000
Thank you for sending me home.

296
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:44,600
How did you regain your consciousness?

297
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:49,000
Yes, how did I regain my consciousness? This is great.

298
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:53,200
By the way, Sister Xiao Ni, I'm going back to help them.

299
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:55,000
- Thanks... <br> - Stop there!

300
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:58,600
What are you both hiding from me?

301
00:23:41,730 --> 00:23:43,660
Zhan Wang,

302
00:23:46,570 --> 00:23:49,650
you have the experience, the skill.

303
00:23:49,650 --> 00:23:53,880
But if you can't overcome your own fear, then it'll all be a waste.

304
00:23:55,530 --> 00:23:59,940
I will definitely prove it to you.

305
00:23:59,940 --> 00:24:03,520
Is that so? If you can't do it,

306
00:24:03,520 --> 00:24:06,590
then you might as well go ride that bike I gave you.

307
00:24:34,240 --> 00:24:39,130
<i>If you can't do it, then you'd might as well go ride that bike I gave you.</i>

308
00:24:44,320 --> 00:24:45,750
Brother Zhan,

309
00:24:48,200 --> 00:24:50,520
what are you doing? It's so hot and you are washing the car. Let's have a game.

310
00:24:50,520 --> 00:24:54,570
I have been feeling tired lately. Just play by yourself.

311
00:24:57,420 --> 00:24:59,620
What's wrong? Not in a good mood?

312
00:24:59,620 --> 00:25:02,320
I'm just getting a sun tan. What do you mean?

313
00:25:02,320 --> 00:25:05,900
Come off it. I know

314
00:25:05,900 --> 00:25:08,270
your training for the race hasn't been smooth.

315
00:25:08,270 --> 00:25:11,660
I have always wanted to talk to you and give you encouragements,

316
00:25:11,660 --> 00:25:15,830
but I was afraid to say the wrong things to make it worse.

317
00:25:16,460 --> 00:25:18,610
We are buddies. Just speak.

318
00:25:18,610 --> 00:25:19,610
I will speak then.

319
00:25:19,610 --> 00:25:21,060
Speak.

320
00:25:21,060 --> 00:25:25,170
Frankly, it's not just only me. The rest of the buddies and Brother Da Yong, too...

321
00:25:25,170 --> 00:25:28,980
We know you have run into problems but we couldn't help at all.

322
00:25:28,980 --> 00:25:31,050
We could only just watch

323
00:25:31,050 --> 00:25:36,470
but we really hope that, Brother Zhan...

324
00:25:37,700 --> 00:25:39,350
About this,

325
00:25:40,610 --> 00:25:42,500
I may disappoint everyone.

326
00:25:42,500 --> 00:25:44,890
Brother Zhan, please don't talk like that.

327
00:25:44,890 --> 00:25:49,350
Okay, go and play.

328
00:25:51,470 --> 00:25:55,040
Brother Zhan.

329
00:25:55,040 --> 00:25:57,010
What?

330
00:25:57,660 --> 00:25:59,080
Which leg is longer?

331
00:25:59,080 --> 00:26:00,360
What do you mean?

332
00:26:00,360 --> 00:26:02,660
One leg is shorter than the other.

333
00:26:03,720 --> 00:26:05,940
Were you injured in the past?

334
00:26:07,330 --> 00:26:12,350
I used to race on a bike. I flew when I went round a bend.

335
00:26:12,350 --> 00:26:14,390
I'll be deformed for life.

336
00:26:18,610 --> 00:26:23,910
Okay, don't talk about this. You can even play basketball now.

337
00:26:23,910 --> 00:26:27,840
I'm fine now, you can even barely say that my leg is agile.

338
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:36,180
But in here, there is a phobia.

339
00:26:36,890 --> 00:26:38,780
I dare not look at a motorbike anymore.

340
00:26:38,780 --> 00:26:43,430
Once I look at one, the scene of the accident will flash through my mind again.

341
00:26:43,430 --> 00:26:46,350
It's just like it's right in front of me.

342
00:26:46,350 --> 00:26:49,270
I'm at that turn again.

343
00:26:49,270 --> 00:26:51,990
A collision and I'm flying.

344
00:26:51,990 --> 00:26:54,900
My face hit something and I fell onto the racetrack.

345
00:26:54,900 --> 00:26:59,080
My eyes were blurry, my mind was blank.

346
00:26:59,080 --> 00:27:03,990
At that time, I was really very scared. I really thought I would die.

347
00:27:08,040 --> 00:27:10,970
Since then, I have never touched a motorbike again.

348
00:27:11,640 --> 00:27:14,850
Till today, thinking about it, I regretted making that decision.

349
00:27:14,850 --> 00:27:18,150
But when I have recovered and if I go back to the race track again,

350
00:27:18,150 --> 00:27:22,980
it would only take once, and I would get past this obstacle.

351
00:27:22,980 --> 00:27:26,500
It has got to be better than how I am now, passing my days in a daze.

352
00:27:26,500 --> 00:27:29,570
Enough. What do you mean by that?

353
00:27:29,570 --> 00:27:31,970
Who hasn't made mistakes in their youth that come back to haunt them?

354
00:27:31,970 --> 00:27:35,990
That's right. Everyone has dreams when they were young.

355
00:27:35,990 --> 00:27:40,070
If one dares to go after that, it's an ideal. If one dares not,

356
00:27:40,070 --> 00:27:43,460
then it'll forever leave a scar in your heart.

357
00:27:44,330 --> 00:27:48,490
Brother Zhan, I was weak back then.

358
00:27:52,190 --> 00:27:54,340
Brother Zhan, you can't be weak.

359
00:28:13,760 --> 00:28:15,070
You are back.

360
00:28:15,070 --> 00:28:16,170
Why are you here again?

361
00:28:16,170 --> 00:28:19,070
Can't I come? I called you a few times but your phone was switched off.

362
00:28:19,070 --> 00:28:21,810
Thus, I could only wait for you here.

363
00:28:21,810 --> 00:28:24,710
I have been busy lately. Perhaps, my battery could have run out.

364
00:28:24,710 --> 00:28:27,000
Let's go in and talk.

365
00:28:35,210 --> 00:28:38,790
Come, sit. Did you wait a long time?

366
00:28:41,140 --> 00:28:44,100
How's your training? I was afraid it would be tough for you.

367
00:28:44,100 --> 00:28:48,320
I bought all these organic veggies for you. You need some nutrition.

368
00:28:48,320 --> 00:28:52,970
I should give you my key so that you don't have to wait outside.

369
00:28:52,970 --> 00:28:55,470
Are things going smoothly?

370
00:28:56,710 --> 00:28:58,460
Yes.

371
00:28:58,460 --> 00:28:59,910
Hey,

372
00:28:59,910 --> 00:29:02,970
I wanted to say, one of my friends is a television host, do you remember?

373
00:29:02,970 --> 00:29:05,670
Right now, he's doing a program about racing fans.

374
00:29:05,670 --> 00:29:09,120
It's very popular. I already recommended you to be the participant. No problem, right?

375
00:29:09,120 --> 00:29:11,070
You recommended me?

376
00:29:11,070 --> 00:29:12,630
That's right.

377
00:29:12,630 --> 00:29:17,930
What's wrong?

378
00:29:17,930 --> 00:29:21,050
If you want to go on the program, it'll be good for your name recognition.

379
00:29:21,050 --> 00:29:24,030
It will be easier for you to find sponsors in the future.

380
00:29:24,030 --> 00:29:27,470
Da Yong was the one who has been finding sponsors for me.

381
00:29:27,470 --> 00:29:30,520
Regarding this, you know my personality.

382
00:29:30,520 --> 00:29:34,470
What if there's an awkward silence? Don't mess around. Listen to me, don't mess around, okay?

383
00:29:34,470 --> 00:29:39,710
How am I messing around? I'm in charge of your publicity, right?

384
00:29:39,710 --> 00:29:42,830
I know. Moreover,

385
00:29:42,830 --> 00:29:47,900
I'm busy now with the training for the race. I'm worried and afraid now...

386
00:29:47,900 --> 00:29:52,000
Zhan Wang, what are you afraid of?

387
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:58,190
- I... <br> - Your right to compete has been cancelled.

388
00:29:58,190 --> 00:30:00,360
Why didn't you tell me?

389
00:30:07,050 --> 00:30:08,990
You are here just because of this?

390
00:30:08,990 --> 00:30:13,330
I'm your girlfriend and a member of your racing team.

391
00:30:13,330 --> 00:30:17,030
Something so major happened. Why did you hide that from me?

392
00:30:17,030 --> 00:30:18,900
Let me resolve this problem on my own.

393
00:30:18,900 --> 00:30:21,610
The problem is you want to settle it on your own.

394
00:30:22,430 --> 00:30:25,240
I know what you are afraid of.

395
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:29,090
You are afraid of the pressure from others. You are afraid you will disappoint them.

396
00:30:29,090 --> 00:30:30,970
You are afraid you can't win,

397
00:30:30,970 --> 00:30:34,390
so you're leaving yourself an escape route. You want to be a deserter, right?

398
00:30:34,390 --> 00:30:36,100
Don't say anymore! Okay?

399
00:30:37,840 --> 00:30:38,890
Am I wrong?

400
00:30:38,890 --> 00:30:43,070
Yes, everything you said is right.

401
00:30:44,280 --> 00:30:49,570
When everyone didn't want me to repair cars and wanted me to compete again,

402
00:30:49,570 --> 00:30:53,720
I did it. You all wanted me to practice and recover my skills before the race,

403
00:30:53,720 --> 00:31:00,090
adjust my situation, and I did it. I did everything, but what if I still can't win?

404
00:31:03,340 --> 00:31:07,720
Zhan Wang, it wasn't because we wanted you to do it.

405
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:12,550
It's a question you have to ask yourself. Do you want to win?

406
00:31:16,920 --> 00:31:20,780
Once I have thought it over, I will tell you.

407
00:31:20,780 --> 00:31:24,930
Let me think about it first. Go back.

408
00:32:00,930 --> 00:32:06,200
I say, Xiao Ni, you have been here for a long time and you have been silent.

409
00:32:06,200 --> 00:32:09,460
It feels like you're here to use the free wifi.

410
00:32:09,460 --> 00:32:14,260
Instead of coming here, why don't you just apologize to him?

411
00:32:14,260 --> 00:32:20,020
Why should I apologize to him. I did that for his own good. I'm not going.

412
00:32:23,630 --> 00:32:26,640
Do you know what your biggest problem is?

413
00:32:26,640 --> 00:32:31,450
You are just too stubborn. Yes, you are always right.

414
00:32:31,450 --> 00:32:35,100
There's a line from a poem, "Moisten all things softly without a sound." Got it?

415
00:32:35,100 --> 00:32:39,830
You go up there and right away, you're all up in his face about it. What man is going to be able to tolerate that?

416
00:32:39,830 --> 00:32:43,880
Whose side are you on, anyway? I did it out of concern.

417
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:45,940
It's just that he can't tell good criticism from bad.

418
00:32:45,940 --> 00:32:48,000
In any case, it was your fault.

419
00:32:49,240 --> 00:32:53,290
He isn't at fault, too? Do you know what the secret for a good relationship is?

420
00:32:53,290 --> 00:32:56,720
It's trust.

421
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:59,930
The secret for a good relationship is trust now?

422
00:32:59,930 --> 00:33:03,030
Your eighteen conditions are not important anymore?

423
00:33:03,030 --> 00:33:05,090
If you didn't bring this up, I would have forgotten.

424
00:33:05,090 --> 00:33:07,430
The last few days, I've been working so hard on this.

425
00:33:07,430 --> 00:33:11,030
Look, I've made a detailed plan for Zhan Wang's future.

426
00:33:11,030 --> 00:33:12,220
What do you think?

427
00:33:12,220 --> 00:33:14,440
No. I say, Tian Xiao Ni.

428
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:16,690
You have gone overboard.

429
00:33:16,690 --> 00:33:19,290
Zhan Wang is not a three-year-old kid.

430
00:33:19,290 --> 00:33:22,370
What do you know? Men usually mature slower than women.

431
00:33:22,370 --> 00:33:26,470
Do you know that saying? Women are mothers when they are young and men become kids when they are older.

432
00:33:26,470 --> 00:33:29,470
Thus, whatever men can't think of, hear or do,

433
00:33:29,470 --> 00:33:33,840
you should do it for them. This is what a smart girlfriend should do.

434
00:33:33,840 --> 00:33:37,580
I only heard about this. Behind every successful man,

435
00:33:37,580 --> 00:33:40,910
there is definitely a woman who is a busybody.

436
00:33:40,910 --> 00:33:43,000
Looks like you've been spending all your time being obsessed.

437
00:33:44,210 --> 00:33:48,200
A man's success and the schemes of the woman behind him

438
00:33:48,200 --> 00:33:52,060
can't be separated. Many good relationships are not just about having a good companion. It's also about maturity.

439
00:33:52,060 --> 00:33:55,940
This is ruining things through excessive enthusiasm.

440
00:33:55,940 --> 00:33:57,610
Don't talk about enthusiasm, I'm almost out of it.

441
00:33:57,610 --> 00:34:01,800
If he were to cancel his rights for the race, all our efforts would go to waste.

442
00:34:01,800 --> 00:34:04,270
Talking about this, it's such a pity, too.

443
00:34:04,270 --> 00:34:06,670
Two days ago when I did a television program,

444
00:34:06,670 --> 00:34:09,510
I recommended Zhan Wang as a participant.

445
00:34:09,510 --> 00:34:11,100
- What's the program? <br> - Matchmaking.

446
00:34:11,100 --> 00:34:16,100
Match... you want my boyfriend to go on a matchmaking program?

447
00:34:16,100 --> 00:34:18,490
Matchmaking is just a topic.

448
00:34:18,490 --> 00:34:21,440
The people on that program are either releasing a new album or a new book.

449
00:34:21,440 --> 00:34:24,960
They're all just there for publicity. Don't be so crude.

450
00:34:24,960 --> 00:34:29,290
He doesn't even want to go on a motorcar program. It will be strange if he goes on a matchmaking program.

451
00:34:29,290 --> 00:34:30,950
Do you want to go with me?

452
00:34:30,950 --> 00:34:33,380
I'm not even an artist. Why would I go with you?

453
00:34:33,380 --> 00:34:36,390
I'm not asking you to be the participant.

454
00:34:36,390 --> 00:34:39,020
I'm asking you to do the wardrobe for the participants.

455
00:34:39,020 --> 00:34:41,480
Aren't you having a financial crisis?

456
00:34:41,480 --> 00:34:44,560
You are so reliable.

457
00:34:44,560 --> 00:34:45,760
I will treat you to a lavish meal.

458
00:34:45,760 --> 00:34:47,370
Of course.

459
00:34:49,020 --> 00:34:54,080
But hasn't Gao Da Yong been taking care of your three meals lately?

460
00:34:54,980 --> 00:34:57,000
I already told him not to come.

461
00:34:57,000 --> 00:34:58,090
Why?

462
00:34:58,090 --> 00:35:00,220
It's nothing. It's just that

463
00:35:00,220 --> 00:35:02,460
he may not come again.

464
00:35:02,460 --> 00:35:05,070
What's wrong with the both of you?

465
00:35:05,070 --> 00:35:06,370
No...

466
00:35:06,370 --> 00:35:08,320
I'm going to open the door.

467
00:35:13,140 --> 00:35:14,070
Who is it?

468
00:35:14,070 --> 00:35:18,940
Miss Gu Jia, I'm from Sea King. Director Gao asked me to deliver your dinner.

469
00:35:18,940 --> 00:35:21,160
Please come in.

470
00:35:34,540 --> 00:35:38,350
Please eat it while it's hot. I wish you good health as soon as possible.

471
00:35:38,350 --> 00:35:39,600
Thanks.

472
00:35:46,420 --> 00:35:50,840
You said he's not coming. Why is the food here?

473
00:35:50,840 --> 00:35:52,800
Enough.

474
00:36:20,180 --> 00:36:27,600
<i>Subtitles and Timing Brought To You By The Gone With The Shirt Team @ Viki</i>

475
00:36:42,770 --> 00:36:44,100
Who...

476
00:36:44,100 --> 00:36:45,780
It's me.

477
00:36:48,530 --> 00:36:53,290
What brings you here?

478
00:36:53,290 --> 00:36:56,930
I thought you were angry with me and wouldn't come again.

479
00:36:56,930 --> 00:36:59,980
Would I dare to be angry with you?

480
00:37:00,860 --> 00:37:04,690
About what happened that day, it was my fault.

481
00:37:04,690 --> 00:37:07,980
I shouldn't have flared up and kicked you out.

482
00:37:07,980 --> 00:37:09,520
Sorry.

483
00:37:10,470 --> 00:37:12,650
You don't have to apologize.

484
00:37:12,650 --> 00:37:14,590
I was at fault, too.

485
00:37:14,590 --> 00:37:19,040
It was between the both of you. I went a bit overboard.

486
00:37:19,040 --> 00:37:23,190
So how was it? I personally ordered the menu for the food delivery for the past few days.

487
00:37:23,190 --> 00:37:24,930
Do they suit your palate?

488
00:37:24,930 --> 00:37:29,200
They were great. The meat and seafood are making me fat.

489
00:37:29,200 --> 00:37:34,300
Seafood is expensive. Stop delivering them and focus on your business.

490
00:37:35,540 --> 00:37:39,440
I guess you would be tired of eating the meat and fish.

491
00:37:39,440 --> 00:37:43,420
Look at this. I'm here to cook light food for you today.

492
00:37:43,420 --> 00:37:48,120
Fermented tofu with spinach. Sweet and sour lotus slices.

493
00:37:48,120 --> 00:37:51,170
Celery and lily. Cold lotus root slices with sauce.

494
00:37:51,170 --> 00:37:55,690
And also, cabbage and shellfish soup. There you go.

495
00:37:58,710 --> 00:38:03,620
Actually, thanks for helping me cut through that tangled mess the other day.

496
00:38:03,620 --> 00:38:07,250
He is definitely not worth doing anything for him.

497
00:38:07,250 --> 00:38:09,890
Give me a hand.

498
00:38:09,890 --> 00:38:13,450
But you said

499
00:38:13,450 --> 00:38:15,830
it takes time to forget someone.

500
00:38:15,830 --> 00:38:20,590
Thus, I was thinking I should pack up his stuff

501
00:38:20,590 --> 00:38:24,650
so that I can slowly forget about him.

502
00:38:25,660 --> 00:38:27,910
How's your packing?

503
00:38:28,520 --> 00:38:33,550
It's almost done. He doesn't have much of his stuff here anyway.

504
00:38:33,550 --> 00:38:37,730
Now, there's just the organic garden on the sundeck.

505
00:38:37,730 --> 00:38:40,390
He personally planted them for me.

506
00:38:40,390 --> 00:38:44,870
I was thinking plants are alive, too.

507
00:38:44,870 --> 00:38:46,780
It would be too cruel.

508
00:38:48,480 --> 00:38:51,050
Well, look. I'm gonna be busy cooking. There will be lots of greasy smoke.

509
00:38:51,050 --> 00:38:54,870
Go and take a rest. I will call you when it's ready.

510
00:38:54,870 --> 00:38:57,740
If you need any help, just call me.

511
00:38:57,740 --> 00:39:00,410
No need. Go.

512
00:39:09,590 --> 00:39:11,140
It's time to eat.

513
00:39:11,140 --> 00:39:13,020
Coming.

514
00:39:15,450 --> 00:39:16,300
Come.

515
00:39:16,300 --> 00:39:18,930
It smells great.

516
00:39:21,500 --> 00:39:26,090
Why didn't you follow the menu you set earlier? What happened to the fermented tofu and spinach?

517
00:39:26,090 --> 00:39:27,580
I forgot to buy it.

518
00:39:27,580 --> 00:39:29,220
And the celery and lily?

519
00:39:29,220 --> 00:39:32,400
It wasn't fresh. I didn't cook it.

520
00:39:32,400 --> 00:39:34,180
Then, what about the cold lotus root with sauce?

521
00:39:34,180 --> 00:39:37,990
Well, if the lotus roots snap but the fibres stay connected, that's so ominous. (suggests that lovers will part but still long for each other) I couldn't make it either.

522
00:39:38,960 --> 00:39:40,550
What did you cook then?

523
00:39:40,550 --> 00:39:43,700
Let me tell you, these are Gao Da Yong original creations.

524
00:39:43,700 --> 00:39:46,030
This one's called the "Breaking All Ties Stir Fry."

525
00:39:46,030 --> 00:39:48,850
This one's called the "Go Separate Ways Small Fried Meat."

526
00:39:48,850 --> 00:39:53,510
This one, it's called "Grow Old and Die Without Ever Crossing Paths Again Stew."

527
00:39:53,510 --> 00:39:58,560
This one... this one is actually the cabbage and shellfish soup.

528
00:40:00,250 --> 00:40:02,040
Try it.

529
00:40:04,070 --> 00:40:05,670
Eat it.

530
00:40:13,690 --> 00:40:15,390
Gao Da Yong!

531
00:40:15,390 --> 00:40:17,960
Why did you pluck all of the organic veggies?

532
00:40:17,960 --> 00:40:19,340
It was just convenient.

533
00:40:19,340 --> 00:40:21,500
What do you mean? You are a murderer!

534
00:40:21,500 --> 00:40:24,870
Do you know how hard I worked to plant those? How could you just pluck them like that?

535
00:40:24,870 --> 00:40:28,220
Why are you so anxious? Didn't you plant these to be edible?

536
00:40:28,220 --> 00:40:29,980
It's unreasonable to expect that you'd just raise them until they die, right?

537
00:40:29,980 --> 00:40:33,000
What do you know? Those were for keepsakes.

538
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:36,570
What keepsakes?

539
00:40:36,570 --> 00:40:38,140
Don't be unreasonable with me.

540
00:40:38,140 --> 00:40:42,000
I come from a long line of cooks. I can't manage to feed you these fresh dishes,

541
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:46,270
and I can't manage my own mouth. What are you so excited about? Sit.

542
00:40:46,270 --> 00:40:50,620
Sit down. I worked hard to cook these.

543
00:40:51,840 --> 00:40:57,670
Eat a bite. I'm telling you, these organic veggies taste great.

544
00:40:59,870 --> 00:41:02,630
Eat this. This is not bad.

545
00:41:04,970 --> 00:41:07,780
What are you staring at?

546
00:41:10,900 --> 00:41:12,940
Frankly speaking,

547
00:41:14,440 --> 00:41:19,780
that rascal Xu Xin is nothing much but he's not bad at growing vegetables.

548
00:41:20,560 --> 00:41:23,840
Pay attention to some organic farms in the outskirts.

549
00:41:23,840 --> 00:41:28,470
If you want to eat organic veggies in the future, just let me know.

550
00:41:28,470 --> 00:41:31,500
Okay, stop being angry .

551
00:41:32,660 --> 00:41:34,930
Look and learn from me.

552
00:41:36,260 --> 00:41:40,390
Put the food in the side of your mouth and chew with all your strength.

553
00:41:40,390 --> 00:41:45,100
After you've chewed it thoroughly, then swallow it. Tomorrow morning, after you wake up, I promise,

554
00:41:45,100 --> 00:41:48,740
you will forget how to write Xu Xin's name.

555
00:42:12,420 --> 00:42:18,970
<i>♫ Suddenly our eyes met, I only heard my heartbeat ♫</i>

556
00:42:18,970 --> 00:42:25,680
<i>♫ But I pretended not to care, as though nothing happened ♫</i>

557
00:42:25,680 --> 00:42:32,280
<i>♫ Time flies, every minute, look forward to see your smile ♫</i>

558
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:38,420
<i>♫ How long do I have to wait for us to meet again? ♫</i>

559
00:42:38,420 --> 00:42:45,360
<i>♫ Why are we separated when we are obviously in love? ♫</i>

560
00:42:45,360 --> 00:42:51,720
<i>♫ Why do we realize that all the mistakes shouldn't have been committed when we turn around? ♫</i>

561
00:42:51,720 --> 00:42:58,820
<i>♫ If we love courageously, love courageously. Why does it leave behind so much pain? ♫</i>

562
00:42:58,820 --> 00:43:06,660
<i>♫ Love courageously, I’ll customize the most beautiful love for you ♫</i>

563
00:43:06,660 --> 00:43:11,640
<i>♫ If only time can prove true love ♫</i>

564
00:43:11,640 --> 00:43:17,540
<i>♫ A moment becomes eternity, you will always know my dream ♫</i>

565
00:43:17,540 --> 00:43:25,900
<i>♫ How many years have I longed for a bright future? You gave me too many heartbeats and touching moments ♫</i>

566
00:43:25,900 --> 00:43:31,720
<i>♫ In the rain, embrace each other again ♫</i>

567
00:43:31,720 --> 00:43:38,880
<i>♫ If we love courageously, love courageously. Why are we separated when we are obviously in love? ♫</i>

568
00:43:38,880 --> 00:43:45,110
<i>♫ Why do we realize that all the mistakes shouldn't have been committed when we turn around? ♫</i>

569
00:43:45,110 --> 00:43:52,100
<i>♫ If there’s a courageous love, and we love courageously. Why does it leave behind so much pain? ♫</i>

570
00:43:52,100 --> 00:43:59,190
<i>♫ Love courageously, I’ll customize the most beautiful love for you ♫</i>

571
00:43:59,190 --> 00:44:05,810
<i>♫ Love courageously, customize the most beautiful love for you ♫</i>

572
00:44:05,810 --> 00:44:11,200
<i>♫ Love courageously, customize the most beautiful love for you ♫</i>

